{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0154-s001", "text": "Vid alla yrkeshögskolor finns också en öppen yrkeshögskola och vid universiteten ett öppet universitet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054808508725+0000-5/hb-c08-u0154-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.846802721088435, "peak": 0.362274169921875, "generation_seconds": 27.31920184683986, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0154-s002", "text": "Vid dem kan vem som helst avlägga universitets- eller yrkeshögskolestudier utan inträdesprov.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054808508725+0000-5/hb-c08-u0154-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.498503401360544, "peak": 0.29638671875, "generation_seconds": 27.7619087100029, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0154-s003", "text": "Det erbjuds både enskilda kurser och större helheter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054808508725+0000-5/hb-c08-u0154-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.269805908203125, "generation_seconds": 18.617525490932167, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0154-s004", "text": "Studierna är avgiftsbelagda.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054808508725+0000-5/hb-c08-u0154-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.1346938775510202, "peak": 0.34698486328125, "generation_seconds": 11.394692481029779, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0154-s005", "text": "I vissa fall kan arbetsgivaren betala arbetstagarens studieavgifter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054808508725+0000-5/hb-c08-u0154-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.37396240234375, "generation_seconds": 17.435134375933558, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0155-s001", "text": "Inom vissa områden kan man via en separat ansökan bli antagen för att avlägga en hel examen vid ett universitet eller en yrkeshögskola, om man först har avlagt en viss mängd studier inom området vid ett öppet universitet eller en öppen yrkeshögskola.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054808508725+0000-5/hb-c08-u0155-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 20.340680272108845, "peak": 0.399993896484375, "generation_seconds": 48.780248320894316, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0156-s001", "text": "För vuxna i Finland finns det utöver yrkesinriktade studier och högskolestudier också ett stort utbud av studier inom det fria bildningsarbetet vid medborgarinstitut, folkhögskolor, studiecentraler och sommaruniversitet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054808508725+0000-5/hb-c08-u0156-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 18.52952380952381, "peak": 0.3209228515625, "generation_seconds": 51.20044510997832, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0156-s002", "text": "De erbjuder många olika slags utbildningar som vem som helst kan delta i.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T054808508725+0000-5/hb-c08-u0156-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.31219482421875, "generation_seconds": 17.20222725882195, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
